<title>SPAIN: Final share allocation for Telefonica offer.</title>
<headline>Final share allocation for Telefonica offer.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state holding company</p>
<p>SEPPa announced the final allocation of its sale of 171 million</p>
<p>Telefonica de Espana shares on Tuesday as follows:</p>
<p>					   No. shares   Price (ptas/share)</p>
<p> General retail tranche	    107,533,989	   3,239</p>
<p> Special retail tranche		6,843,071</p>
<p>    Workers/pensioners		 5,132,304	   3,171</p>
<p>    Pension funds			1,710,767	   3,104</p>
<p> Spanish institutional tranche    11,339,945	   3,360</p>
<p> International tranches	     45,359,795	   3,360</p>
<p>    American			    17,690,320</p>
<p>    Continental Europe		11,339,949</p>
<p>    British			     13,154,340</p>
<p>    Rest of world			3,175,186</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
</text>
